[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12062.07, "timestamp": "03:21:02", "text": "他们没有出道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12064.309, "timestamp": "03:21:04", "text": "当时时间还很早。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12071.429, "timestamp": "03:21:11", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12078.79, "timestamp": "03:21:18", "text": "星空，真是太搞笑了，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12081.349, "timestamp": "03:21:21", "text": "我找到了关于星空（Starscape）的信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12085.51, "timestamp": "03:21:25", "text": "然后我看到了一些广告，比如我会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12087.59, "timestamp": "03:21:27", "text": "比如播放 YouTube 视频，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12090.79, "timestamp": "03:21:30", "text": "突然间，毫无预兆地，就像祖奇一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12092.95, "timestamp": "03:21:32", "text": "会以广告的形式出现，我就会想：咦？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12101.03, "timestamp": "03:21:41", "text": "这真是个非常明智的举动，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12104.229, "timestamp": "03:21:44", "text": "Po 的这边好像有广告之类的东西"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12104.885, "timestamp": "03:21:44", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "sky scrape?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12106.95, "timestamp": "03:21:46", "text": "接着她开始推广她的 YouTube 频道。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12112.79, "timestamp": "03:21:52", "text": "但现在我不这么认为了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12116.55, "timestamp": "03:21:56", "text": "现在看来是个好主意。为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12118.469, "timestamp": "03:21:58", "text": "因为它带来了观众"}]